OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court after body
OL,4,Afound in bin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 36-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with murdering a man whose body
OL,8,Fwas found partially in a wheelie bin
OL,10,FMohamed Abotaka, of Grand Parade,
OL,11,FPlymouth, Devon, appeared via a video
OL,12,Flink from HMP Bristol, accused of
OL,13,Fmurdering Ali Barzai between 20 October
OL,14,Fand 21 October.
OL,16,FBarzai, 52, was found in a service lane
OL,17,Foff Grand Parade, in the West Hoe area
OL,18,Fof the city, on 21 October.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
