OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court after body
OL,4,Afound in bin
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbotaka's barrister Ali Rafati did not
OL,7,Fapply for bail and the defendant was
OL,8,Fremanded in custody. He is due to next
OL,9,Fappear in court on 24 November for a
OL,10,Fplea and trial preparation hearing.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
